; ── Vedia · Nature Witch ───────────────────────────────────────
; Battle focus: Green-color healing  ＋  Life Rain (heal x2)  ＋  Blue-color defense

@stopBgm
@bgm white
@back bg04 time:0.3
@char 薇狄亞 pos:50 time:0

薇狄亞.smile: Oh my, a new friend~ Care to have a little match with me?

@choice "Sure, count me in!" goto:.battle_intro
@stop

# battle_intro
薇狄亞.love: The true nature of natural magic isn't just offense — vitality is the mightiest weapon.
薇狄亞: I hope you feel the gentleness and resilience of nature for yourself... Let's begin!

@hide 薇狄亞
@set RuneActive=true
@battle background:bg04 target:monster02 scriptName:demo_vivia label:afterbattle
@stop


; ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# afterbattle
; ─────────────────────────────────────────────────

@stopBgm
@bgm white
@back bg04 time:0.3
@char 薇狄亞 pos:50 time:0

薇狄亞.idle: Mm... not bad. Could you feel the rhythm of natural magic?
薇狄亞.talking: Go swap for a new rune and take the strength you learned today with you.

@hide 薇狄亞
@GotoChangeRune scriptName:demo label:aftermap
@stop
